    },
    {
      "id": "3.58.3",
      "label": "3.58.3",
      "numbers": [
        3
      ],
      "devanagari": "राज्य भ्रष्टस्य दीनस्य दण्डकान् परिधावतः |\nक्व सा दुःख सहाया मे वैदेही तनु मध्यमा",
      "iast": "rājya bhraṣṭasya dīnasya daṇḍakān paridhāvataḥ |\nkva sā duḥkha sahāyā me vaidehī tanu madhyamā",
      "translation": "\"When I have become forlorn with the forfeiture of my kingdom and when I was rushing for Dandaka forest she stood with me as a partaker in my woes. She that comely Vaidehi, where is she?",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
