    {
      "id": "3.58.4",
      "label": "3.58.4",
      "numbers": [
        4
      ],
      "devanagari": "याम् विना न उत्सहे वीर मुहूर्तम् अपि जीवितुम् |\nक्व सा प्राण सहाया मे सीता सुर सुत उपमा",
      "iast": "yām vinā na utsahe vīra muhūrtam api jīvitum |\nkva sā prāṇa sahāyā me sītā sura suta upamā",
      "translation": "\"Without whom I am disinclined to live even for a moment, oh, valiant one, such a Seetha who in simile is like the daughter of deities and who is my life-force, where is she?",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
