          "iast": "mithyā na bhaviṣyati kaccit",
          "devanagari": "मिथ्या न भविष्यति कच्चित्",
          "meaning": "illusory [futile,] not, become, someway.",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": null
        }
      ]
