    {
      "id": "3.58.8",
      "label": "3.58.8",
      "numbers": [
        8
      ],
      "devanagari": "स पुत्र राज्याम् सिद्ध अर्थाम् मृत पुत्रा तपस्विनी |\nउपस्थास्यति कौसल्या कच्चित् सौम्येन - सौम्य न - कैकयीम्",
      "iast": "sa putra rājyām siddha arthām mṛta putrā tapasvinī |\nupasthāsyati kausalyā kaccit saumyena - saumya na - kaikayīm",
      "translation": "\"Kaikeyi is with her son, with a kingdom, and further her 'purposes are achieved,' oh, gentle Lakshmana, and because of the death of her son will my austerely mother Kausalya humbly get into the servitude of Kaikeyi, anyhow!",
