      "label": "3.58.9",
      "numbers": [
        9
      ],
      "devanagari": "यदि जीवति वैदेही गमिष्याम्य् आश्रमम् पुनः |\nसुवृत्ता यदि वृत्ता सा प्राणान् त्यक्ष्यामि लक्ष्मण",
      "iast": "yadi jīvati vaidehī gamiṣyāmy āśramam punaḥ |\nsuvṛttā yadi vṛttā sā prāṇān tyakṣyāmi lakṣmaṇa",
      "translation": "\"I wish to get at the hermitage again if only that Vaidehi of good-conduct is alive in hermitage, else, oh, Lakshmana, if death has already conducted her out of hermitage I too will give up my lives here itself.",
