    {
      "id": "3.58.11",
      "label": "3.58.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "ब्रूहि लक्ष्मण वैदेही यदि जीवति वा न वा |\nत्वयि प्रमत्ते रक्षोभिः भक्षिता वा तपस्विनी",
      "iast": "brūhi lakṣmaṇa vaidehī yadi jīvati vā na vā |\ntvayi pramatte rakṣobhiḥ bhakṣitā vā tapasvinī",
      "translation": "\"Say Lakshmana, whether that pietistic Vaidehi is alive or not? Or, on your becoming unmindful of your guard is she consumed by demons, either?",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
