          "iast": "sarvathā",
          "devanagari": "सर्वथा",
          "meaning": "in everyway",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "tava api bhayam janitam",
          "iast": "tava api bhayam janitam",
          "devanagari": "तव अपि भयं जनितं",
          "meaning": "in you, even, fear, is caused.",
          "anvayaIndex": 6,
          "verseIndex": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3.58.14",
      "label": "3.58.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "श्रुतः च मन्ये वैदेह्या स स्वरः सदृशो मम |\nत्रस्तया प्रेषितः त्वम् च द्रष्टुम् माम् शीघ्रम् आगतः",
      "iast": "śrutaḥ ca manye vaidehyā sa svaraḥ sadṛśo mama |\ntrastayā preṣitaḥ tvam ca draṣṭum mām śīghram āgataḥ",
      "translation": "\"I hope that Vaidehi has also heard that voice which is similar to that of mine, and I hope frightened as she is she might have also hastened you, and I hope you also have come to see me, that hastily!",
      "notes": [
        "Annex: 'maybe, as a woman she is hopeless of my capabilities, but you are a coequal of mine, are you unhopeful of my capabilities and came rushing at the haste of a hasty woman, or what!"
      ],
      "glosses": [
        {
