          "iast": "trastayā preṣitaḥ tvam ca",
          "devanagari": "त्रस्तया प्रेषितः त्वं च",
          "meaning": "frightened as she is, hastened, you, also",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 8
        },
        {
