          "iast": "mām draṣṭum śīghram āgataḥ",
          "devanagari": "मां द्रष्टुं शीघ्रं आगतः",
          "meaning": "me, to see, hastily, you have came.",
          "anvayaIndex": 6,
          "verseIndex": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3.58.15",
      "label": "3.58.15",
      "numbers": [
        15
      ],
      "devanagari": "सर्वथा तु कृतम् कष्टम् सीताम् उत्सृजता वने |\nप्रतिकर्तुम् नृशंसानाम् रक्षसाम् दत्तम् अन्तरम्",
      "iast": "sarvathā tu kṛtam kaṣṭam sītām utsṛjatā vane |\npratikartum nṛśaṃsānām rakṣasām dattam antaram",
      "translation": "\"In everyway you have caused hardship by leaving Seetha in isolation, and a leeway is given to the diabolical demons for a counterattack against us.",
      "notes": [
        "Aside: 'anyway, a congratulatory hardship is caused by you to the demonic race, in unleashing Seetha in isolation from our fetters, and a leeway is given to those diabolic demons as well as to me... as I cocksurely attack them now in the name of Seetha, and it is cocksure that they have to surface now to counterattack me, instead of these tricks and gimmicks...'"
      ],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "siitaam vane utsR^ijataa",
          "iast": "sītām vane utsṛjatā",
          "devanagari": "सीतां वने उत्सृजता",
          "meaning": "Seetha, in forest, by you in leaving off [in isolation]",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 4
        },
        {
          "itrans": "sarvathaa kaSTam kR^itam",
          "iast": "sarvathā kaṣṭam kṛtam",
          "devanagari": "सर्वथा कष्टं कृतं",
          "meaning": "in everyway, hardship, is caused",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "prati kartum",
          "iast": "prati kartum",
          "devanagari": "प्रति कर्तुं",
          "meaning": "for counter, attack - to take revenge",
          "anvayaIndex": 2,
          "verseIndex": 7
        },
        {
          "itrans": "nR^ishamsaanaam rakSasaam antaram dattam",
          "iast": "nṛśamsānām rakṣasām antaram dattam",
          "devanagari": "नृशम्सानां रक्षसां अन्तरं दत्तं",
          "meaning": "for diabolical, demons, leeway, is given.",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3.58.16",
      "label": "3.58.16",
      "numbers": [
        16
      ],
      "devanagari": "दुःखिताः खर घातेन राक्षसाः पिशित अशनाः |\nतैः सीता निहता घोरैः भविष्यति न संशयः",
      "iast": "duḥkhitāḥ khara ghātena rākṣasāḥ piśita aśanāḥ |\ntaiḥ sītā nihatā ghoraiḥ bhaviṣyati na saṃśayaḥ",
      "translation": "\"Raw-flesh eating demons are distraught as I have liquidated Khara, as a result those ghastly ones would have liquidated Seetha by now. There is no doubt about it.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "pishita ashanaaH raakSasaaH",
          "iast": "piśita aśanāḥ rākṣasāḥ",
          "devanagari": "पिशित अशनाः राक्षसाः",
          "meaning": "raw-flesh, eaters, demons",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 3
        },
        {
          "itrans": "khara ghaatena duHkhitaaH",
          "iast": "khara ghātena duḥkhitāḥ",
          "devanagari": "खर घातेन दुःखिताः",
          "meaning": "Khara, [on my] liquidating, they are distraught - they are distraught on my liquidating Khara",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "ghoraiH taiH",
          "iast": "ghoraiḥ taiḥ",
          "devanagari": "घोरैः तैः",
          "meaning": "ghastly ones, by them",
          "anvayaIndex": 2,
          "verseIndex": 6
        },
        {
          "itrans": "siitaa nihataa bhaviSyati",
          "iast": "sītā nihatā bhaviṣyati",
          "devanagari": "सीता निहता भविष्यति",
          "meaning": "Seetha, liquidated, she would have been",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 7
        },
        {
          "itrans": "samshayaH na",
          "iast": "samśayaḥ na",
          "devanagari": "सम्शयः न",
          "meaning": "doubt, is not there.",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3.58.17",
      "label": "3.58.17",
      "numbers": [
        17
      ],
